<title>USA: Community Financial sets 5 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Community Financial sets 5 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMONT, N.J. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Financial Holding Corp said Friday it approved a five percent stock dividend payable December 16, to holders of record of its common stock as of December 1.</p>
<p>The company said this is the sixth consecutive annual five percent stock dividend payed by the company.</p>
</text>
